# opencode.json — Template

> **⚠️ Template — create during workshop**  
> This file is a template. Participants will configure their own `opencode.json` during the workshop setup.

## Configuration Template

```json
{
  "agents": {
    "default": {
      "model": "adesso/qwen-3.6-35b-sovereign",
      "small_model": "ollama/llama3.2:3b",
      "reasoning_model": "ollama/qwen3.5:9b-mlx"
    }
  },
  "ai_hub_setup": {
    "sovereign_model": "qwen-3.6-35b-sovereign",
    "cloud_model": "gpt-4-turbo",
    "budget_limit_usd": 50
  }
}
```

## Workshop Setup

1. Copy this template to your project root: `cp opencode.json.template opencode.json`
2. Follow `docs/tools/VS-CODE-AI-HUB-SETUP.md` for detailed configuration
3. Validate with: `cat opencode.json | python3 -m json.tool`
